/* 115 年疼痛專科歷屆考題。請保留原始題號與官方答案；醫學驗證另行記錄。 */
window.PAIN_EXAM_SEEDS=(window.PAIN_EXAM_SEEDS||[]).concat([{"id":"official-115-1","year":115,"number":1,"topic":"未分類","text":"下列幾項關於疼痛名詞的定義或說明，依照Bonica’s Management of Pain 5th ed或疼痛學 理，哪一項是錯誤？","options":["Anesthesia dolorosa: Spontaneous pain in an area or region that is anesthetic","Catastrophizing: A cognitive and emotional process which can be an important predictor of negative response to both acute and chronic pain","Chronic widespread pain includes nonradicular back pain, fibromyalgia, irritable bowel syndrome, pelvic pain, tension-type headache, and temporomandibular disorders (TMD).","Conditioned pain modulation: a mechanism can be assessed by measuring tonic pain response after a conditioned phasic pain stimulus","Hyperpathia: A painful syndrome characterized by an abnormally painful reaction to a stimulus"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。Conditioned pain modulation（CPM）常以持續性、具疼痛性的 conditioning stimulus（例如冷壓刺激）影響另一個短暫 test stimulus 的疼痛評分；題目 D 把 phasic test 與 tonic conditioning 的方向顛倒。A 麻木區自發痛、B 災難化思考、E hyperpathia 均是適當定義；C 混列慢性廣泛疼痛與常見功能性疼痛疾患，概念應區分，並非各病都滿足 widespread pain 定義。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019; Chapter 2 Pain terms and Taxonomies of pain , p.229-231; (D) Conditioned pain modulation: a mechanism can be assessed by measuring “phasic” pain response after a conditioned “tonic” pain stimulus","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-2","year":115,"number":2,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which one of the following statement about the pathophysiology of herpes zoster is wrong?","options":["Herpes zoster most commonly manifests in the distribution of a single dorsal sensory or cranial nerve ganglion.","Why the reactivation of virus occurs in one ganglion when latent virus is present throughout the patient’s sensory ganglia is clear.","Declining cellular immunity is a major risk factor for reactivation of the virus, which is thought to occur when cell-mediated immunity falls below a critical level.","This impression is supported by evidence that even individuals with adequate levels of serum antibodies to varicella-zoster virus (VZV) antigen can, over time, exhibit T cells with reduced ability to proliferate and defend against VZV infections.","Cell-mediated immunity appears to play a crucial role in preventing reactivation of latent VZV."],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 B。VZV 潛伏於感覺神經節；細胞免疫下降是再活化的重要條件，但為何特定單一神經節先再活化，機轉並未完全明瞭，故 B 的 'is clear' 錯。A 的單側皮節分布典型；C、D、E 均強調 VZV-specific T-cell immunity 比單看血清抗體更重要。參照原卷 Bonica Ch27。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019; Chapter 27 Herpes Zoster and Postherpetic Neuralgia, Pathophysiology of Herpes Zoster and Mechanisms of Acute Pain, Why the reactivation occurs in one ganglion when latent virus is present throughout the patient’s sensory ganglia is not clear, p1283","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-3","year":115,"number":3,"topic":"未分類","text":"關於癌症疼痛的臨床評估與藥物管理，下列敘述何者最正確？","options":["Meperidine (Pethidine)由於其起效快且具有獨特的NMDA拮抗作用，是癌症慢性疼痛長 期管理的首選藥物之一。","癌症引起的神經病變痛 (Neuropathic cancer pain) 應僅靠增加鴉片類藥物劑量來控制，不 應合併使用輔助藥物 (Adjuvants) 以免增加交互作用風險。","WHO三階梯止痛原則 (WHO Analgesic Ladder) 仍被視為教條，臨床上必須嚴格遵守由第 一階（非鴉片類藥物）開始，失敗後方能進入下一階。","在癌症疼痛的藥物治療中，針對中度至重度疼痛（Step 2 & 3），使用「低劑量強效鴉片類 藥物」（如低劑量 Morphine 或 Oxycodone）來取代弱鴉片類藥物（如 Codeine），通常能 提供更好的療效且更容易進行劑量滴定 (Titration)。",""],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。中至重度癌痛可依疼痛程度使用低劑量強效 opioid 並漸進滴定，不必機械式從弱 opioid 逐階失敗才升級。A meperidine 不適合長期治療，normeperidine 具神經毒性，NMDA 拮抗是 methadone 的重要特性；B 神經病變癌痛可搭配 adjuvants；C WHO ladder 是原則不是不可變通的教條。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain( Fifth Edition)；Chapter43. Cancer Pain: Principle of Management and Pharmacotherapy（Page 650-652, 655-658）","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-4","year":115,"number":4,"topic":"未分類","text":"對於脊髓損傷後疼痛 (Pain Following Spinal Cord Injury)的分類、診斷與治療敘述，下列何 者最正確？","options":["脊髓損傷患者最常見的骨骼肌肉疼痛 (Musculoskeletal pain) 通常與廢用性萎縮有關，臨 床上極少發生在肩關節。","根據國際脊髓損傷疼痛 (ISCIP) 分類，損傷平面下神經痛 (Below-level neuropathic pain) 被歸類為一種中樞性疼痛，通常出現在損傷平面以下超過三個皮節的區域。","針對 SCI 後的中樞性神經痛，藥物治療應優先考慮強效鴉片類藥物 (Strong Opioids)， 而非Gabapentinoids或三環抗憂鬱劑 (TCAs)。","脊髓後根進入區毀損術 (DREZ lesioning) 是目前治療「Below-level 廣泛性神經痛」最具 實證支持的第一線神經外科手術。",""],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 B。ISCIP 分類的 below-level neuropathic pain 常位於神經損傷平面以下超過 3 個皮節，屬中樞神經病變痛。A SCI 病人肩痛很常見，尤其輪椅推進與移位；C gabapentinoids／部分抗憂鬱劑通常比強效 opioid 優先；D DREZ 並非瀰漫性 below-level pain 的通用第一線處置。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain( Fifth Edition)；Chapter40.Pain following spinal cord injury（Page 603-605, 609-612）","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-5","year":115,"number":5,"topic":"未分類","text":"下列有關opioid-induced hyperalgesia (OIH, 鴉片類藥物誘發之痛覺過敏)之敘述，何者較不正確?","options":["OIH和pioid analgesic tolerance有許多相似之處","和活化dorsal horn之NMDA receptor有關","和活化下行疼痛路徑抑制系統(descending pain inhibition systems)-RVM有關","OIH也可引起pro-inflammatory cytokines釋放，而引發類似發炎反應","於圍術期間合併給予gabapentinoids, NSAIDs, acetaminophen以及ketamine等藥物，可將術後鴉片類藥物誘發之痛覺過敏（OIH）降至最低"],"officialAnswer":"C","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 C。OIH 涉及 NMDA 活化、神經免疫發炎及 rostroventromedial medulla（RVM）下行促痛 facilitation，而不是單純活化下降抑痛系統，所以 C 較不正確。A 耐受與 OIH 可並存，須靠臨床表現區分；B、D 涉及中樞敏化和細胞激素；E 多模式止痛可能降低 opioid 暴露，但不能保證完全預防 OIH。","officialNote":"考題出處：(P1523, 1530, 1532, 1539)","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-6","year":115,"number":6,"topic":"未分類","text":"生氣(Anger)等情緒反應在慢性疼痛病人當中可能較為頻繁出現，下列何者並非評估Anger的量表？","options":["State-trait anger expression inventory (STAXI-2)","Short form 36 (SF-36)","Targets and reasons for anger in pain sufferers (TRAPS)","Multi-dimensional anger inventory (MAI)","Anger disorders scale (ADS)"],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 B。STAXI-2、TRAPS、MAI、ADS 均為生氣、憤怒或其表達模式相關評估；SF-36 是一般健康相關生活品質量表，含身體功能、疼痛及心理健康面向，並非專門量化 anger 的工具。臨床可同時使用一般生活品質和情緒特異量表，但不能混同測量構念。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019;Chapter 83 Anger and Pain,TABLE 83.3 Instruments Designed to Assess Anger, p.4309-4311","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-7","year":115,"number":7,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the followings clinical indicators with its suspected pathology for spinal pain is suggested to receive X-ray for first line test?","options":["fracture due to severe trauma","aortic aneurysm with cardiovascular risk factors","weight loss due to tumor","suspected infection with fever, sweating","x-ray is not a first line test for the above causes of spinal pain"],"officialAnswer":"A","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"disputed","explanation":"官方 A（影像策略有時代差異）。疑似外傷性骨折需影像評估，傳統教材可先做 X-ray；但高能量、嚴重創傷時，現代急診常依風險和部位優先使用 CT，所以『嚴重外傷以 X-ray 為第一線』不能泛化。B 主動脈疾病應用血管影像；C 腫瘤與 D 感染紅旗通常需進一步 MRI／相應檢查；E 過度否定了 X-ray 的用途。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019; Chapter 72 Acute Low Back Pain,TABLE 72.2 Clinical Indicators and Preferred Investigations for Possible Serious Causes of Spinal Pain, p3878-3879","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":["severe trauma 現代影像選擇常優先 CT；官方 X-ray 敘述有時代差異"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-8","year":115,"number":8,"topic":"未分類","text":"下列何者不是偏頭痛（migraine）常見症狀？","options":["單側性疼痛","搏動性疼痛","痛到眼窩後方","噁心嘔吐","對光與聲音敏感"],"officialAnswer":"C","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"disputed","explanation":"官方 C（語意需留意）。ICHD-3 偏頭痛的典型診斷要素是 4–72 小時、單側／搏動／中重度／活動加重，以及噁心或畏光畏聲，故 A、B、D、E 符合常見表現；C 眼窩後疼痛不是必要或特異的診斷準則。但偏頭痛確實可以在眼窩後方疼痛，不能解讀為『不會出現』。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019; Chapter 61 Headache, Migraine, Table 61.3 Simplified Diagnostic Criteria for Migraine, p3215","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"ICHD-3: Migraine without aura","url":"https://ichd-3.org/1-migraine/1-1-migraine-without-aura/"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":["眼眶後疼痛仍可能見於 migraine，不能等同非偏頭痛症狀"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-9","year":115,"number":9,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which one of the following statement is correct?","options":["Functional imaging techniques applied for the study of pain are positron emission tomography (PET), functional magnetic resonance imaging (fMRI), near-infrared spectroscopy (NIRS), multi-channel electroencephalography (EEG) and magnetoencephalography (MEG), and intracranial recordings.","NIRS is an optical approach that also analyses changes in hemoglobin oxygenation levels by using light in the near infrared range (650 to 950 nm).","EEG and MEG are noninvasive neurophysiologic techniques that measure the respective electrical potentials and magnetic fields generated by neuronal activity of the brain and propagated to the surface of the skull where they are picked up with EEG electrodes or, in the case of its magnetic counterpart, received by supra conducting quantum interference device (SQUID) sensors located outside the skull.","Invasive recordings, which are assessed during neurosurgical interventions in patients ongoing epileptic surgery, or deep brain stimulation (DBS) procedures (most common in Parkinson disease), are extremely helpful to directly measure supraspinal pain signals.","All of the above are correct."],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E。PET 量測代謝／血流相關訊號，fMRI 常見為 BOLD，NIRS 利用近紅外線估計血氧變化；EEG/MEG 量測不同形式的神經電磁活動，臨床需要時亦可直接顱內記錄。A～D 都屬神經功能研究方法；但這些量測不是直接讀取主觀疼痛強度的『客觀痛分數』。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019; Chapter 6 Supraspinal Mechanisms of Pain and Nociception, Functional Imaging of Pain in Humans, p378-380","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-10","year":115,"number":10,"topic":"未分類","text":"關於介入性疼痛治療的敘述，下列何者最符合教科書中提到的臨床實證與處置原則？","options":["神經毀損性腹腔神經叢阻斷術（Neurolytic Celiac Plexus Block, NCPB）應嚴格保留至癌症末期且對高劑量鴉片類藥物完全產生耐受性後才可施行。","星狀神經節阻斷術（Stellate Ganglion Block）主要用於治療腰薦椎神經叢引起的神經痛，注射位置通常定於第六腰椎 (L6) 橫突處。","對於腰椎神經根疼痛，經椎間孔硬脊膜外類固醇注射（Transforaminal ESI）相較於經椎板間注射（Interlaminar ESI），能更精準地將藥物送達腹側硬膜外腔，但也伴隨較高的脊髓動脈誤入風險。","脊髓刺激器（Spinal Cord Stimulation, SCS）的首要適應症是針對單純、局限性的傷害感受性背痛 (Nociceptive back pain)，而非放射性神經痛。",""],"officialAnswer":"C","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 C。Transforaminal ESI 針對發炎神經根與腹側 epidural space 的遞藥路徑較直接，但必須預防誤入根動脈、非預期血管內注射及罕見神經血管併發症。A 神經叢毀損不必一律等末期且 opioid 完全失效；B stellate ganglion 在頸部而非 L6；D SCS 較具證據的是特定難治性神經病變痛，非單純局限性 nociceptive back pain。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain( Fifth Edition); Chapter44.Interventional pain therapies （Page 671-673, 676-678, 683-686）","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"Cohen & Ross 2024 TFESI safety review","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/39011664/"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-11","year":115,"number":11,"topic":"未分類","text":"關於腰椎椎間盤盤源性疼痛(lumbar discogenic pain)的敘述，何者正確？","options":["核磁共振中，常見有T2訊號降低、high intensity zone、modic change、椎間盤厚度減少等。 尤其在椎間盤厚度減少的部分，如果剩下的厚度低於鄰近健康椎間盤的50%，是lumbar discogenic pain的機會大幅上升","當annular tear惡化至disc herniation甚至有神經根壓迫時，保守治療有效的機會較低，應該更積極使用orthobiologics進行椎間盤注射來促進突出的椎間盤吸收","超音波可看到腰椎神經孔附近的神經及小血管，是腰椎椎間盤介入治療最精準安全的影像導引工具","Modified Dallas Scale是一個annular tear嚴重度的量表，其中grade III指的是顯影劑擴散到整個annulus fibrosis的外三分之一","Biacuplasty是一種針對椎間盤盤源性疼痛的神經阻斷治療，所要阻斷的神經是posterior annulus上的basivertebral nerve"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。Modified Dallas grading 的 grade III 表示裂隙／顯影劑延伸至 annulus 外三分之一；更進展者可有環狀裂隙。A 影像退化徵象非單獨診斷標準，厚度比也非絕對門檻；B orthobiologics 不是已證實可促使突出椎間盤吸收的標準療法；C 椎間盤注射不以超音波作最準確的標準導引；E basivertebral nerve 偏重椎體終板相關疼痛，非後方 annulus biacuplasty 的目標。","officialNote":"考題出處：Ch101, Intradiscal therapies for low back pain","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-12","year":115,"number":12,"topic":"未分類","text":"依照目前臨床文獻，下列何種診斷及可能對應的神經阻斷術何者有誤？","options":["cervicogenic headache – third occipital nerve radiofrequency (RF) neurotomy","lumbar facet joint pain – lumbar medial branch RF denervation","trigeminal neuralgia – Gasserian ganglion RF neuroablation","post-herpetic neuralgia – splanchnic nerve RF denervation","sacroiliac joint pain – sacral lateral branch denervation"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。Splanchnic nerves 傳遞上腹內臟交感相關痛覺，不是皮節性帶狀疱疹後神經痛（PHN）的標準 RF 標的。A third occipital nerve 可涉及 C2–3 facet 的頸因性頭痛；B medial branch 可處理選定小面關節痛；C Gasserian ganglion 可用於部分難治三叉神經痛；E SIJ 相關疼痛可考慮 sacral lateral branch RF，須經適當選案。","officialNote":"考題出處：Ch102, neurolytic blockade for noncancer pain","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-13","year":115,"number":13,"topic":"未分類","text":"關於三叉神經痛(trigeminal neuralgia)，下列何者正確？","options":["典型的三叉神經痛是間歇性疼痛，每次發作大概會維持數十分鐘以上","顱內血管對三叉神經節的壓迫是重要的病因之一，其中最常見造成神經壓迫的血管是superior cerebellar artery","三叉神經痛的藥物治療中，最主要的藥物是carbamazepine或oxcarbamazepine。其中carbamazepine因為有Steven-Johnson syndrome的風險，在開藥前常建議先抽血檢驗HLA-B27","目前診斷的gold standard是利用超音波導引在foramen ovale附近做診斷性注射","在radiofrequency treatment的目標選擇中，在多於一條三叉神經分支有三叉神經痛時，為減少治療部位的繁複及降低風險，直接進行sphenopalatine ganglion denervation才是最cost-effective的做法。"],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"disputed","explanation":"官方 B，但敘述位置不精確。典型 classical trigeminal neuralgia 常因 superior cerebellar artery 壓迫 trigeminal nerve 的 root entry zone，而不是『壓迫三叉神經節』。A 發作通常為數秒至約 2 分鐘；C 嚴重皮膚不良反應篩檢要注意 HLA-B*15:02（特定族群），不是 HLA-B27；D 以臨床病史／神經檢查並輔以 MRI 為診斷核心；E SPG 不是多分支三叉神經痛的標準取代治療。","officialNote":"考題出處：Ch104, The Surgical Management of Trigeminal Neuralgia","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"ICHD-3 Classical trigeminal neuralgia","url":"https://ichd-3.org/13-painful-cranial-neuropathies-and-other-facial-pains/13-1-trigeminal-neuralgia/13-1-1-classical-trigeminal-neuralgia/13-1-1-1-classical-trigeminal-neuralgia-purely-paroxysmal/"},{"title":"CERSI-PGx 2026 carbamazepine HLA guideline","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/42002301/"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":["SCA 壓迫部位應是 trigeminal root entry zone，非 trigeminal ganglion"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-14","year":115,"number":14,"topic":"未分類","text":"下列何者非為催眠(Hypnosis)在疼痛醫學中可能的應用範圍？","options":["Cancer pain management","Perioperative anxiolysis","Chronic low back pain","Local anesthetic systemic toxicity","Headache"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。催眠與暗示、注意力重導向等可在癌痛、圍術期焦慮、慢性下背痛、頭痛等作為輔助介入，證據程度因情境不同而異。Local anesthetic systemic toxicity（LAST）是可能危及生命的急症，應立即停藥、處理氣道與痙攣、考慮脂肪乳及復甦，不能以 hypnosis 取代治療。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019; Chapter 86 Hypnosis,TABLE 86.1 Common Applications of Hypnosis in Medicine, p.4398-4399; Chapter 112 Emergencies in the Pain Clinic, Local Anesthetic Systemic Toxicity, p5368-5370","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-15","year":115,"number":15,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which one of the following does not belong to opioid receptor gene family?","options":["MU","DELTA","KAPPA","Cannabinoid receptor","ORL1"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。經典 opioid receptor 家族含 μ（MOR）、δ（DOR）、κ（KOR）及 nociceptin/orphanin FQ receptor（NOP/ORL1），皆為 GPCR。Cannabinoid CB1/CB2 雖也是 GPCR，卻屬不同受體家族，不是 opioid receptor 基因家族的一員。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019; Chapter 4 Substrates of Spinal Cord Nociceptive Processing, Opioids, p334-335; Chapter 79 Opioid Analgesics, Classification Based on Interactions with an Opioid Receptor, p4121;Chapter 24 Painful neuropathies, Cannabinoids, Cannabinoid receptors, CB1 and CB2, p1167","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-16","year":115,"number":16,"topic":"未分類","text":"下列有關於2015 年美國FDA 對於NSAID 之警語中，何者為非？","options":["Risk appears to increase with higher doses","NSAID use increase risk of heart failure","There is insufficient evidence to determine the risk of individual NSAIDs","NSAIDs use in patients with risk factors for heart disease does not increase the likelihood of heart attack or stroke","NSAIDs increase the risk of heart attack/stroke regardless of existing heart disease"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。FDA NSAID 心血管警語指出心肌梗塞／中風風險可在有或沒有既存心臟病者增加，心血管高風險者絕不因此免疫，所以 D 錯。較高劑量與風險增加相關（A），也可能加重心衰（B）；各個 NSAID 的相對心血管危害難用單一結論排列（C）；E 符合警語核心。另需留意 aspirin 的特殊地位。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019; Chapter 78 Nonsteroidal Anti-inflammatory Drugs and Acetaminophen, 2015 U.S. Food and Drug Administration NSAID Warning, p4102","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-17","year":115,"number":17,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of following description about non-steroidal anti-inflammatory drugs (NSAIDs) pharmacology is \"Correct\"?","options":["NSAIDs work by inhibiting the inflammation associated enzyme cyclooxygenase and lipoxygenase","Perioperative use of NSAIDs will not increase the risk of surgical site bleeding","NSAIDs will not have drug-drug interaction with anticoagulant (such as warfarin)","Cyclooxygenase-2 (Cox-2) is the inducible isoform of cyclooxygenase but is constitutively expressed in certain tissues such as brain and kidney","Compared with non-selective NSAIDs, long term use of Cox-2 inhibitors will significantly reduce the risk of serious cardiovascular events, renal failure or congestive heart failure."],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。COX-2 常是 inducible isoenzyme，卻在腎臟與 CNS 等組織亦可 constitutively expressed。A 一般 NSAID 抑制 cyclooxygenase，不是常規抑制 lipoxygenase；B 術中 NSAID 出血風險需依藥物和情境判斷，不能說一律不增加；C 與抗凝血藥可增加出血風險；E COX-2 選擇性不代表心腎風險更低。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019; Chapter 78 Nonsteroidal Anti-inflammatory Drugs and Acetaminophen, p4069-4110;...including the central nervous system (CNS) and the Kidney, constitutively express COX-2, p4075","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-18","year":115,"number":18,"topic":"未分類","text":"下列有關neuropathy (神經病變)之敘述，何者較不正確?","options":["small fiber neuropathy 常出現allodynia 的特徵","small fiber neuropathy 是屬於neuropathic pain","small fiber neuropathy 通常是Aδ 或 c-fiber sensory axon 出現異常","Electromyography (NCS/EMG) 可檢測是否有small fiber neuropathy","周邊神經損傷後，亦會伴隨脊髓層級的訊號處理重組。未髓鞘化的 C 纖維選擇性退化，作為代償反應；Aδ 與 Aβ 纖維可能發生 sprouting (萌芽)並延伸進入背角第二層（lamina II）"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。標準 nerve conduction studies／needle EMG 主要評估較大的有髓神經纖維及肌肉，對 isolated small fiber neuropathy（Aδ、C fiber）常呈正常。必要時以皮膚 biopsy 的 IENFD、定量感覺測試或自主神經測試輔助。A～C 合乎小纖維神經病變可能的表現；E 所述 sprouting 是某些病理模型假說，不能當每位患者必發機制。","officialNote":"考題出處：(P1141-1143, P1250)","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-19","year":115,"number":19,"topic":"未分類","text":"下列何者不屬於central pain (中樞性疼痛) 之第一線治療藥物?","options":["Tricyclic antidepressants (TCAs)","Serotonin-norepinephrine reuptake inhibitors (SNRIs)","Gabapentin,","Tramadol","Pregabalin"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。中央神經病變痛藥物可考慮 TCAs、SNRIs、gabapentin 或 pregabalin，依病因與證據程度調整；tramadol 雖可能有止痛效果，因 opioid 風險與有限證據並非典型第一線。SCI 或 stroke 等中樞疼痛的直接 RCT 證據並不一致，不能把所有藥一概視為同效。","officialNote":"考題出處：(Fig. 28.3, P1361)","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"AAN neuropathy pharmacotherapy guideline","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/34965987/"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-20","year":115,"number":20,"topic":"未分類","text":"Phantom pain (幻肢痛)及Residual limb pain (殘端疼痛) 之敘述，何者較不正確?","options":["截肢病人出現殘端疼痛發生率有50 %","幻肢痛的病因複雜, 包括周邊、脊髓層級、脊髓上及心理等因素","殘端疼痛常發生在肢體遠端截肢的病人","出現幻肢痛病人當中，在截肢後一週發生的可高達75%","以手術方式切除neuroma(神經瘤)，可以減輕殘端疼痛"],"officialAnswer":"C","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 C（流行病學描述需謹慎）。Residual limb pain 可以來自 neuroma、感染、缺血、義肢壓迫、骨刺等，並非僅由遠端截肢決定；所以 C 的過度一般化不適當。A、D 的發生率與時間點高度依族群與研究定義；B 幻肢痛涉及周邊、脊髓、腦部重組和心理因素；E 在選定疼痛性 neuroma 病人可考慮手術，但不是保證有效。","officialNote":"考題出處：(P1246-1249)","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-21","year":115,"number":21,"topic":"未分類","text":"關於radiofrequency這項疼痛治療技術，下列哪些敘述是正確的？ (1) 其燒灼的原理和機制與外科手術用的電燒類似；(2) 在置放燒灼針時，燒灼針平行貼近神經時成效優於垂直神經；(3) 燒灼的lesion size和燒灼時間成正比，也因為燒灼過久會導致範圍無限擴大，造成風險，每次燒灼療程都會限制在90秒以內；(4) 使用16 gauge電燒針時lesioning的範圍比20 gauge的針還大；(5) neurostimulation時會以0.5V以內得到電刺激反應來確認電燒針和神經的距離夠近","options":["(1, 4, 5)","(2, 3, 4)","(1, 3, 4)","(2, 4, 5)","(2, 3, 5)"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D（2、4、5）。熱 RF 的能量來自針尖周圍組織離子振盪產熱，與直接外科電燒不同，(1) 不精確；平行貼近目標神經通常較能涵蓋較長神經段，(2) 正確；lesion 隨時間增大但逐漸接近平衡，不會無限擴張也非硬性 90 秒上限，(3) 錯；較粗的 16G 針往往形成更大 lesion，(4) 對；(5) 0.5V 以內誘發感覺反應是常用參考，不是安全或定位的充分條件。","officialNote":"考題出處：Ch102, neurolytic blockade for noncancer pain","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-22","year":115,"number":22,"topic":"未分類","text":"一名58 歲男性，罹患轉移性癌症，長期接受嗎啡治療以控制疼痛。近兩個月來，病患多 次要求增加嗎啡劑量，主訴疼痛加劇。進一步評估顯示： • 影像學證實腫瘤進展 • 病患近期活動量增加 • 無失控用藥、無渴求（craving）、無違反用藥指示 • 當疼痛控制改善後，頻繁要求加藥的行為亦隨之消失 下列何者最能正確描述該病患的情況？","options":["Addiction","Pseudoaddiction","Tolerance","Pseudotolerance","Aberrant behavior"],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 B，且需避免把舊概念當正式診斷。舊稱 pseudoaddiction 是指因疼痛治療不足而出現貌似尋藥的行為，疼痛改善後消失；本例有影像證實腫瘤進展，無 craving 或失控使用，所以最符合出題意圖。現今不宜僅靠『加藥要求』替病人貼成癮或 pseudoaddiction 標籤；仍要系統評估疼痛、疾病與用藥風險。","officialNote":"考題出處：根據 Table 59.1 的定義","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":["pseudoaddiction 是舊術語，不宜當正式診斷標籤"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-23","year":115,"number":23,"topic":"未分類","text":"一名28歲女性，反覆頭痛發作約 1 年。每次頭痛持續約 12–24 小時，疼痛位於單側，呈搏動性，伴隨噁心與畏光。理學檢查正常，無神經學缺損。下列何者最符合偏頭痛（migraine）診斷條件？","options":["頭痛合併發燒與頸部僵硬","頭痛持續 15–180 分鐘並伴隨流淚","頭痛為雙側、持續數分鐘","頭痛為單側搏動性，並伴隨噁心與畏光","頭痛每日發作 10 次以上"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":"D","verified":"verified","explanation":"官方 D。未治療偏頭痛典型持續 4–72 小時，單側／搏動且合併噁心、畏光畏聲，個案最符合 D。A 發燒與頸僵屬次發性頭痛紅旗；B 15–180 分鐘合併自主神經症狀偏向 cluster headache；C 極短暫雙側不典型；E 一日多次要鑑別三叉自律神經性頭痛。","officialNote":"頭痛為單側搏動性，並伴隨噁心與畏光 考題出處：Table 61.3","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"ICHD-3: Migraine without aura","url":"https://ichd-3.org/1-migraine/1-1-migraine-without-aura/"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-24","year":115,"number":24,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the following statements regarding regional anesthesia is incorrect?","options":["spinal migration of the epidural catheter and intrathecal administration of epidural drugs are more likely occurred with the needle through needle technique.","hydrophilic opioids remain within CSF after neuraxial administration and produce a delayed but long duration of analgesia","previous back surgery and back pain are considered contraindications for neuraxial techniques","single-shot neuraxial administration of a hydrophilic opioids is appropriate for longer duration analgesia","lipophilic opioids provide analgesia via either a spinal or systemic mechanism"],"officialAnswer":"C","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 C。既往背部手術或背痛本身不構成 neuraxial anesthesia 的絕對禁忌，應個別評估解剖變形、植入物、神經症狀及操作可行性。A needle-through-needle CSE 可增加導管位置／誤入蛛網膜下腔的相關考量；B、D hydrophilic opioid（如 morphine）起效較慢但作用持久且需監測遲發性呼吸抑制；E lipophilic opioid 亦可能有全身性作用。","officialNote":"考題出處：Chapter 52 p.852 & 853","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-25","year":115,"number":25,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the following statements regarding burn pain is NOT true?","options":["the amount of morphine received by burn-injured children may impact their subsequent development of posttraumatic stress disorder (PTSD).","second-degree burns are associated with marked hyperalgesia and produced moderate to severe pain.","procedure pain usually high intensity but limited duration.","Third-degree burns with marked hyperalgesia and produced severe pain","oral and transmucosal administration of opioids was particularly advantageous in those burn patients without IV access and in children."],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。深度 full-thickness（三度）燒傷核心因神經末梢破壞，局部可能反而感覺減弱；周邊部分厚度燒傷區仍會劇痛，所以 D 把第三度本身描述成 marked hyperalgesia 不妥。B 二度燒傷痛覺敏感；C 換藥、清創等 procedural pain 劇烈而短暫；A 充分處理兒童燒傷痛可能影響後續創傷經驗；E 非靜脈途徑可有應用但須考慮吸收及氣道。","officialNote":"考題出處：Chapter 53 p.897-902","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-26","year":115,"number":26,"topic":"未分類","text":"一名29歲女性 因急性下腹痛就醫，合併輕微陰道出血。驗孕呈陽性，但經陰道超音波未能確認子宮內懷孕。生命徵象穩定。下列何者為最適當的下一步處置？","options":["直接出院門診追蹤","給予經驗性抗生素治療","追蹤血清β-hCG 並重複影像檢查","立即安排腹腔鏡手術","立即安排骨盆MRI"],"officialAnswer":"C","verifiedAnswer":"C","verified":"verified","explanation":"官方 C。驗孕陽性、經陰道超音波尚未辨認宮內或宮外孕且生命徵象穩定，屬 pregnancy of unknown location（PUL）；須定量 serial β-hCG、依時間重複 TVUS 並交代子宮外孕警訊。A 直接放任追蹤可能漏診；B 無感染指徵；D 無不穩定或破裂證據時非必然立即手術；E MRI 不是此時常規第一步。若出現休克、腹膜刺激徵或嚴重出血須立即處置。","officialNote":"追蹤血清 β-hCG 並重複影像檢查 考題出處：According to the ectopic pregnancy section in Chapter 64: Early ectopic pregnancy may not be visible on initial ultrasound. Stable patients should undergo serial β-hCG monitoring and repeat imaging. Immediate surgery is reserved for hemodynamically unstable patients. This conservative but vigilant approach is emphasized in early ectopic pregnancy management.","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"Society of Family Planning 2025: PUL guidance","url":"https://societyfp.org/clinical_guidances/management-of-undesired-pregnancy-of-unknown-location-and-very-early-abortion/"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-27","year":115,"number":27,"topic":"未分類","text":"A patient suffered from chronic low back pain with radiating to buttock, poster lateral thigh and lateral aspect of lower leg. Muscle weakness was observed in the extensor hallucis longus and tibialis anterior. Which lumbosacral root compression is the most likely?","options":["L2 root compression","L3 root compression","L4 root compression","L5 root compression","S1 root compression"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。EHL（伸拇長肌）、tibialis anterior 背屈無力，加上臀部到小腿外側的放射痛，最符合 L5 nerve root radiculopathy。L4 偏膝伸與內側小腿，S1 偏蹠屈、Achilles reflex 與小腿後側／足外側；L2–L3 則以股前側與髖屈／膝伸表現為主。仍須結合感覺、反射與影像。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019; Chapter 9 Functional Neuroanatomy of the Nociceptive System,Figure 9.1 The dermatomes..,p503","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-28","year":115,"number":28,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which one of the following nociceptors is confirmed by microneurography with psychophysical experiments?","options":["Rapidly adapting (flutter, vibration) and slowly adapting (pressure) cutaneous echanoreceptors,","Aδ-mechanonociceptors (AM [mechano]; sharp pain),","C-polymodal nociceptors (CM [mechano] H[heat]; dull, burning [heat] pain),","Muscle nociceptors (cramping pain).","All of the above"],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E。Microneurography 直接記錄單一周邊感覺神經纖維，搭配定量刺激及受試者報告，可將機械感覺器、Aδ 機械傷害感受器、C polymodal nociceptor 等活動與感覺連結；某些肌肉傳入與抽筋痛亦有相關生理證據。A～D 代表不同纖維／刺激－感覺對應，並非只有一種能被記錄。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019; Chapter 3 Peripheral Pain Mechanism and Nociceptor Sensitization, Box 3.1, Microneurography:....Microneurography has confirmed in psychophysical experiments sensations associated with activation of rapidly adapting (flutter, vibration) and slowly adapting (pressure) cutaneous mechanoreceptors, Aδ-mechanonociceptors (AM[mechano]; sharp pain), C-polymodal nociceptors (CM[mechano]H[heat]; dull, burning [heat] pain), and group IV muscle nociceptors (cramping pain). p265-266","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-29","year":115,"number":29,"topic":"未分類","text":"For peripheral pain mechanisms and nociceptor sensitization, which one of the following statement is wrong?","options":["Sensory neurons commonly identified as nociceptors are those with myelinated (A-fiber) axons, big cell body diameters (> 50 μm), that terminate in the deep layers of the spinal cord dorsal horn.","The presence or absence of certain markers (e.g., the tetrodotoxin (TTX)-resistant sodium channel NaV1.8, the transient receptor potential vanilloid receptor TRPV1) have been used to identify subsets of nociceptors.","More recently, with the ability to analyze many genes expressed in a single cell, patterns of gene expression have been used to further define subpopulations of nociceptors.","With respect to cell body size and myelination, it should be appreciated that there exist some large diameter cells with heavily myelinated and rapidly conducting axons that have been documented functionally to be nociceptors.","Many non-nociceptors have unmyelinated axons, and thus, axon myelination or cell diameter cannot be applied as reliable criteria to define a nociceptor."],"officialAnswer":"A","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 A。典型 nociceptors 以小／中型 DRG soma、C 或薄髓鞘 Aδ 傳入及表淺背角終末為多，並非一律為直徑大於 50 μm、粗有髓、深層終末。B NaV1.8/TRPV1 可作亞群標記；C single-cell transcriptomics 進一步解析類型；D 也存在較粗傳導軸突的傷害感受器；E 直徑與髓鞘單獨都不足以精準界定 nociceptor。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019; Chapter 3 Peripheral Pain Mechanism and Nocic","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-30","year":115,"number":30,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the following description for Electrodiagnostic testing (EDX) in diagnosis of pain is wrong?","options":["nerve conduction studies (NCS) has high sensitivity (>80%) and specificity (>80%) in Carpal tunnel syndrome (CTS)","EDX can distinguish between axonal, demyelinating, and mixed polyneuropathies","Abnormal needle electromyography (EMG) predicts long-term pain relief after lumbar interlaminar or translaminar epidural steroid injection in the treatment of lumbosacral radiculopathy","EDX is not useful in the majority of Complex regional pain syndrome (CRPS) patients","All of the above are correct descriptions"],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"disputed","explanation":"官方 E，但題幹語意有問題：若 A～D 均正確，問『哪項 wrong』卻選 E『all correct』是邏輯不一致的設計。A CTS 的 NCS 有臨床診斷價值，但靈敏度會受輕度病例及操作標準影響；B EDX 可協助區分軸突型與脫髓鞘型；C EMG 異常可影響部分 ESI 預後研究，但不能絕對預言長期效果；D 多數 CRPS 並無特異 EDX 診斷標記。此題以官方 E 計分並標示瑕疵。","officialNote":"考題出處：page 925-928, CHAPTER 18 Electrodiagnostic in Pain Medicine","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":["題幹問 wrong，但 E 寫 all correct，需辨認為題目邏輯瑕疵"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-31","year":115,"number":31,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the following occasion neuroimaging is suggested?","options":["patients with headache and a normal neurologic examination","patients with typical migraine","adult and pediatric patients with known migraine and no change in symptoms","Acute onset of an extremely severe headache","stable subacute headache"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。突發『一生最劇烈』的 thunderclap headache 需排除 subarachnoid hemorrhage、血管性疾病等，應緊急安排適當神經影像與後續檢查；已知典型偏頭痛、神經檢查正常且型態穩定的 A/B/C/E，通常不因頭痛本身就例行影像。但若有神經缺損、癌症、免疫低下、孕產期等紅旗，需個別調整。","officialNote":"考題出處：page 933, CHAPTER 19 Diagnostic imaging of pain","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-32","year":115,"number":32,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the following descriptions for assessment tool of pain intensity is wrong? (Numerical Rating Scale (NRS), Verbal Ratings Scale (VRS), and Visual Analog Scale (VAS))","options":["in measurement by telephone or with electronic diaries, NRS and VRS measures tend to be preferred over VAS","measurement by VAS usually demonstrate more missing data than by NRS","Greater difficulty in completing VAS measures is associated with increased age and greater opioid intake","Patients who are unable to complete NRS ratings may be able to complete VRS pain ratings","All of the above are correct."],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"disputed","explanation":"官方 E，但題目反問『哪一項 wrong』與 E『All ... correct』存在選項邏輯混淆。A 電話或電子日記常易使用 NRS/VRS；B VAS 完成率較差、缺漏可能較多；C 高齡／高 opioid 使用有時使 VAS 操作較難；D 不易使用 NRS 者可改採文字敘述量表。四項均有教材依據，故官方意圖是『A～D 均正確』。","officialNote":"考題出處：Page, 1117, CHAPTER 20, Measurement of pain","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":["題幹問 wrong，但 E 寫 A～D 全部正確"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-33","year":115,"number":33,"topic":"未分類","text":"Choose the incorrect description regarding cancer-related bone pain:","options":["Prostate cancer is very likely to metastasize to bone rather than other organs.","intralesional injection is associated with many complications, should be avoided","Bisphosphonates are now a routine part of therapeutic regimen for metastasis bone pain.","Radioisotope bone scan are very good at identifying of multifocal lesions.","None of above is right"],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 B。骨轉移疼痛可結合局部放療、抗骨吸收藥、手術固定及選定介入治療；將所有 intralesional injection 簡化成『併發症多、應完全避免』過度絕對，因此 B 為教材意圖的錯誤項。A 前列腺癌常有骨轉移，C bisphosphonates 可降低 skeletal-related events，D bone scan 能尋找多灶病變；E『以上皆錯』也不符合 A/C/D，題幹選項設計不夠嚴謹。","officialNote":"考題出處：Chapter 46 p.744-747","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-34","year":115,"number":34,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the following measure is not designed for diagnosis or classification of pain?","options":["Leeds Assessment of Neuropathic Symptoms and Signs (LANSS)","Self-Report Leeds Assessment of Neuropathic Symptoms and Signs (S-LANSS),","Neuropathic Pain Diagnostic Questionnaire (DN4)","Numerical Rating Scale (NRS)","All of the above measure can be used to classify the pain"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。LANSS、S-LANSS 與 DN4 用來篩檢／協助辨識 neuropathic pain 的特徵；NRS 只將疼痛強度量化，例如 0–10 分，不能獨立分類疼痛機轉。A–C 是神經病變痛辨識工具，D 是強度評分工具，因此 E『都可分類』不成立。篩檢量表亦不能取代神經學診斷。","officialNote":"考題出處：page 993-996, CHAPTER 20, Measurement of pain","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-35","year":115,"number":35,"topic":"未分類","text":"當組織受損導致侵害感受器敏化（Sensitization）時，下列哪一種蛋白激酶 C（Protein kinase C, PKC）異構體（Isoform）被認為在調節神經元興奮性中扮演特別重要的角色？？","options":["PKC-α","PKC-γ","PKC-ϵ","PKC-δ",""],"officialAnswer":"C","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 C。PKC-ε（epsilon）可透過磷酸化離子通道及下游訊號參與 nociceptor sensitization，降低刺激閾值、增加神經元興奮性，是周邊痛覺敏化的重要 isoform。α、γ、δ 也可能參與不同神經系統訊號，但教科書特別強調 ε 對周邊傷害感受器的角色。","officialNote":"考題出處：Chap 3 P287","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-36","year":115,"number":36,"topic":"未分類","text":"下列關於「鴉片類藥物誘發之痛覺過敏」（Opioid-induced hyperalgesia, OIH）及其機制的敘述，何者正確？？","options":["OIH 僅發生在具有功能性 μ、κ、δ 鴉片受體的神經系統中","使用局部麻醉藥阻斷 RVM 可消除由嗎啡誘發的痛覺過敏現象","這種現象主要是由於脊髓中 物質 P（Substance P）的缺乏所引起","OIH 僅影響原本疼痛的區域，不會擴散到其他非疼痛區域",""],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 B。RVM 的 descending facilitation 參與 OIH，實驗中抑制 RVM 活性可減少 morphine-induced hyperalgesia。A 非僅靠傳統 opioid receptor 才會發生，還牽涉 NMDA/膠細胞訊號；C OIH 不是 substance P 缺乏；D OIH 可出現在原本疼痛區域以外並增加廣泛痛敏感性。動物實驗機轉不等同臨床直接處置建議。","officialNote":"考題出處：Chap 5 P369","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-37","year":115,"number":37,"topic":"未分類","text":"關於慢性疼痛的「操作制約」（Operant conditioning），下列敘述何者正確？","options":["疼痛行為（Pain behaviors）純粹由生理損傷引起，不受環境強化影響","配偶的關切反應（Solicitous responses）通常能有效減少病人的疼痛行為","逃避行為（Avoidance behavior）可透過減少與傷害性刺激相關的痛苦，在短期內獲得「負強化」（Negative reinforcement）","該理論主張疼痛行為應與「裝病」（Malingering）視為同義詞",""],"officialAnswer":"C","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 C。Operant conditioning 中，逃避或迴避動作暫時讓痛苦／預期威脅下降，故行為得到 negative reinforcement，增加未來再次迴避的機率。A 疼痛行為受生物、情緒、社會回饋影響；B 過度保護式關切在某些情境可強化疼痛行為；D 行為學機制不代表病人欺瞞或裝病，應避免汙名化。","officialNote":"考題出處：Chap 7 P430、438","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-38","year":115,"number":38,"topic":"未分類","text":"關於傷害感受訊號向大腦傳遞的途徑，下列敘述何者正確？","options":["腹外側丘腦（VPL）主要接收來自面部的傷害感受資訊","側向丘腦皮質系統（Lateral thalamocortical system）主要負責疼痛的空間定位、強度及持續時間的分析","屏狀核（Insula）和前側扣帶回（Anterior cingulate gyrus）與疼痛的辨別維度（Discriminative aspect）無關","脊髓網狀束（Spinoreticular tract）僅傳導健側（同側）的疼痛訊號，且與術後疼痛持續無關",""],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 B。Lateral thalamocortical pathway 經 VPL/VPM 到 somatosensory cortex，與疼痛位置、強度與時間辨別較相關；內側網路、insula、ACC 牽涉情緒動機、顯著性與整合，不能說完全與辨別無關。A 面部主要到 VPM 而非 VPL；C insula/ACC 也參與多面向處理；D spinoreticular 多屬交叉上行路徑且與覺醒／情緒相關。","officialNote":"考題出處：Chap 9 P511、513、514","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-39","year":115,"number":39,"topic":"未分類","text":"For substrates of spinal cord nociceptive processing, which one of the following statement is wrong?","options":["The spinal cord is segregated into areas that, on gross examination, appear as white and grey matter and consist of predominantly myelinated nerve fiber tracts and cell bodies, respectively.","The morphology of neurons in the grey matter of the spinal cord differs depending on location.","Using Rexed’s cytoarchitecture-based classification system, there are at least 10 different layers or laminae of neurons—of which the first six (I to VI) are termed the ventral horn of the spinal Cord","Lamina II is called the substantia gelatinosa due to its gross jellylike appearance in fresh cut tissue.","For Lamina X, neurons are arranged around the central canal of the spinal cord."],"officialAnswer":"C","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 C。Rexed laminae I–VI 是 dorsal horn，而非 ventral horn；VII–IX 在中間區／腹角，X 圍繞中央管。A 灰質主要含神經元胞體、白質多有髓軸突；B 灰質神經元形態依區域不同；D lamina II 即 substantia gelatinosa；E lamina X 環繞 central canal。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019; Chapter 4 Substrates of Spinal Cord Nociceptive Processing, Figure 4.2 Diagrams showing Rexed's laminar histologic organization.... The dorsal horn corresponds to laminae I thought VI inclusive, p313","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-40","year":115,"number":40,"topic":"未分類","text":"For substrates of spinal cord nociceptive processing, which one of the following statement is wrong?","options":["The dorsal root ganglion and brainstem nuclei are home to second-order neurons, the first step of central nervous system (CNS) processing.","Although it seems like a simple statement that pain-related second-order neurons are the neurons which receive primary afferent input related to tissue damage (i.e., from nociceptors), it must be accepted that this statement may or may not be wholly true because in certain pathologic states, pain can be evoked by non–tissue-damaging stimuli (allodynia).","A proto-oncogene, c-fos, is activated after potentially tissue-damaging stimuli are applied to most tissues.","A systematic comparison study of Fos and pERK as markers of spinal nociceptive activation revealed greater specificity for activity in nociceptive pathways (vs. nonnociceptive activation) using pERK.","Analgesic pharmacologic manipulations such as systemic morphine reduce both the total number of labeled neurons and the total Fos or pERK content of the spinal cord following a noxious stimulus."],"officialAnswer":"A","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 A。DRG 容納的是感覺 first-order pseudounipolar neurons；第二級神經元主要在脊髓 dorsal horn 與腦幹感覺核，因此 A 將 DRG 與二級神經元混同。B allodynia 說明非 nociceptor 亦可驅動疼痛；C c-Fos、D pERK 是實驗活化標記（pERK 常較具特異性）；E morphine 可減少傷害刺激後標記表現。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019; Chapter 4, Substrates of Spinal Cord Nociceptive Processing, The spinal cord (dorsal horn) and brainstem nuclei are home to second-order neurons, the first step of central nervous system (CNS) processing, p305; Second-order nociceptive spinal dorsal horn neurons frequently have axonal extensions projecting to rostral (and caudal) sites of termination.","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-41","year":115,"number":41,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the following is not true about post-mastectomy pain?","options":["Mastectomy may result in chronic pain in as many as half of those patients.","This pain often starts immediately or a few days postoperatively.","This pain is usually neuropathic in character.","It is suspected that the intercostobrachial nerve is often damaged during axillary node Dissection","The incidence of phantom breast syndrome 1 year after surgery is less than 5%."],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E。乳房切除後的 persistent postmastectomy pain 常具神經病變特徵，腋下清掃損及 intercostobrachial nerve 是重要機轉，故 A–D 大致符合教材描述；E 幻乳（phantom breast）並非一年後低於 5% 的罕見現象，不同研究及定義下比率可明顯更高。幻乳感覺與幻乳疼痛發生率應分開理解。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019; Chapter 69, Chest Wall Pain, Postsurgical Chest Wall pain, Phantom breast syndrome has been a common occurrence after a mastectomy in the past, p3707; reference,p3748 ->121. Krøner K, Knudsen UB, Lundby L, et al. Long-term phantom breast syndrome after mastectomy. Clin J Pain 1992;8:346–350 \" The incidence of phantom pain and nonpainful phantom sensations was 12.7% and 11.8%, respectively, after a year,\"","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-42","year":115,"number":42,"topic":"未分類","text":"下列關於lateral femoral cutaneous nerve (LFCN) 的敘述，何者正確：","options":["來自腰神經叢的 L2, L3 神經根，支配大腿前外側的感覺功能，及股外側肌(Vastus lateralis) 的運動功能","此神經在經過腸骨脊(iliac crest)上方時，容易被壓迫引起「擠壓神經痛」 (entrapment neuralgia)，可能原因包括：懷孕、肥胖、腹腔腫瘤、穿戴厚重鉛衣或腰帶、長期坐位或 站立、甚至骨科髖關節置換手術後等","神經病變症狀包括 感覺喪失或低下(sensory loss or hypoesthesia)、異常感覺(dyeesthesia)、 或疼痛；一般單側發生，很少見雙腳同時出現","理學檢查包括pelvic compression test 和 Ober’s test，或以神經學 EMG, SSEP 確認","LFCN neuralgia 又被稱為 meralgia paresthetica"],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E。LFCN 是由 L2–L3 發出的純感覺神經，受壓導致 meralgia paresthetica，大腿前外側麻木、灼熱或異感。A 不支配 vastus lateralis 運動；B 易受壓處主要是 ASIS 附近 inguinal ligament；C 可雙側，並非幾乎不可能；D Ober test 主要評估 IT band，常規肌電圖也未必能顯示 LFCN 病變。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019.;Chapter 70 Lower Extremity Pain; Lateral femoral cutaneous nerve entrapment, p3759-3763; 解釋：(A) LFCN 是 pure sensory; (B) 經過 inguinal ligament 接近 ASIS 處 (C) 20% 雙側發生 (D) Ober test 是 iliotibial band 的 PE, 而 LFCN 的 EMG 大多為正常","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-43","year":115,"number":43,"topic":"未分類","text":"以下那個選項不是發生 local anesthetics systemic toxicity (LAST)時的正確處理?","options":["Suppress seizures: Benzodiazepines preferred","使用amiodarone 做為第一線 antiarrhythmic","避免使用calcium channel blockers, beta blockers","若使用lipid emulsion 解毒,病人回復hemodynamic stable 即立即停止繼續給予 lipid emulsion","Maximum dose lipid emulsion 大約12 mL/kg IV"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":"D","verified":"verified","explanation":"官方 D。ASRA LAST checklist：發作痙攣優先 benzodiazepine，避免 beta blocker、calcium channel blocker 等；需要時使用 20% lipid emulsion，**血流動力學穩定後仍應持續輸注至少約 15 分鐘**，累積量上限約 12 mL/kg。不能一穩定即停，所以 D 錯；A/C/E 符合清單，B 題目所述心律不整處理仍需考慮適應症與 LAST 專用復甦流程。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019;Chapter 112 Emergencies in the Pain Clinic, Local Anesthetic Systemic Toxicity, p5368-5370;A 20% lipid emulsion may be administered as a 1.5 mL/kg bolus followed by a 0.25 mL/kg/min infusion for 30 to 60 minutes. A repeat bolus is often administered for persistent cardiovascular collapse. It should be noted that the lipid emulsion infusion should be continued for at least 10 minutes after hemodynamic stability is achieved. p5370","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"ASRA LAST checklist","url":"https://asra.com/docs/default-source/guidelines-articles/local-anesthetic-systemic-toxicity-rgb.pdf"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-44","year":115,"number":44,"topic":"未分類","text":"Neuropathic pain 有多種不同原因,治療藥物的選擇必須依照病因決定,請問下列敘述,何者錯誤?","options":["Amitriptyline 對Spinal cord injury 的neuropathic pain 治療效果不佳","Amitriptyline 對 phantom limb pain 的治療效果不佳","Venlafaxine 對postmastectomy syndrome 的治療效果不佳","Selective Serotonin and Norepinephrine Reuptake Inhibitors 治療painful diabetic neuropathic pain 的NNT (number needed to treat)比TCA 小","Selective Serotonin and Norepinephrine Reuptake Inhibitors(SNRI)一般比 Selective Serotonin Reuptake Inhibitors(SSRI)對neuropathic pain 的治療效果好"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 D。傳統彙整資料中 painful diabetic neuropathy 的 TCA NNT 往往較低，不能概括稱 SNRI 的 NNT 一定比 TCA 小；但跨試驗、劑量與結局比較 NNT 有很大限制，較新的 AAN 指引把 TCA、SNRI、gabapentinoids 等視為可選藥物。A/B/C 是特定病因的舊研究結果，不能推論藥物對所有患者無效；E SNRI 對神經病變痛通常比 SSRI 證據較充分。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019;Chapter 81 Neuropathic Pain Pharmacotherapy; Table 81.2, Table 81.3;p4199-4205;A meta-analysis of trials for the SNRIs (i.e., duloxetine, venlafaxine, desvenlafaxine) across neuropathic pain types resulted in an NNT of 6.4 (95% CI, 5.2 to 8.4), indicating that they are less effective than the far less expensive TCAs ( Cochrane collaboration review found the NNT of TCAs for neuropathic pain to be 3.6)","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"AAN 2022 painful diabetic neuropathy guideline","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/34965987/"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-45","year":115,"number":45,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which of the following principal sensory functions in nociceptive afferents terminating as free nerve endings is wrong?","options":["transduction of external or internal chemical or physical stimuli into generator potentials","transformation of a generator potential into an action potential","propagation of the action potential toward the central nervous system.","release of neurotransmitters and neuromodulators into the superficial dorsal horn of the spinal cord or brainstem","All of the above are correct descriptions"],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E，但題幹使用『which is wrong』而 E 卻表示 A–D 全部正確。A 感受器把刺激 transduce 成 generator potential；B 達閾值時轉換為 action potential；C 軸突傳導入 CNS；D 中樞終端釋出 glutamate、peptides 等。四步驟皆是傷害感受神經基本功能，E 的用意是『沒有錯誤敘述』。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019; Chapter 3 Peripheral Pain Mechanisms and Nociceptor Sensitization, Figure 3.1: Nociceptive afferents terminate as free nerve endings in skin and other tissues. A: Their principal sensory functions consist of (1) transduction of external or internal chemical or physical stimuli into generator potentials, (2) transformation of a generator potential into an action potential, (3) propagation of the action potential toward the central nervous system, and (4) releaseof neurotransmitters and neuromodulators into the superficial dorsal horn of the spinal cord or brainstem. p273","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-46","year":115,"number":46,"topic":"未分類","text":"關於腰椎盤因性背痛(discogenic back pain)，以下的敘述何者較正確？","options":["診斷標準中，MRI 影像必須出現椎間盤的 HIZ (high intensity zone)","腰椎CT 電腦斷層出現椎盤上下椎體在 T1WI 灰黑色，T2WI 出現亮白色，代表椎體水腫，定義為Modic Type 1 病變","盤因性疼痛病人，一般不會出現慢性背痛加放射性下肢痛","根據國際脊椎介入學會 2013 年的定義，椎盤注射誘發的再現性疼痛 (concordant pain)，盤內壓力必須達到大於 20 psi (0.14 kPa) 以上","目前研究顯示，椎盤內診斷性注射的效度(validity)不高，容易出現偽陽性"],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"disputed","explanation":"官方 B 有明確筆誤。Modic type 1 的特徵是 **MRI** T1 低訊號、T2 高訊號的終板附近骨髓變化，不是 CT 的 T1WI/T2WI；若照原句則 B 不成立。A HIZ 並非診斷必要條件；C discogenic pain 可合併 referred leg pain；D 低壓 concordant discography 並非大於 20 psi 才算；E provocative discography 的偽陽性與病人選擇、技術相關，不能絕對宣稱無效。本站保留學會 B 作答鍵但將此題標為有爭議。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019.;Chapter 73 Chronic Low back pain, p3924-3927; 解釋：(A) HIZ 比率約 20-30 % 病人；(C) 仍有可能出現放射性痛；(D) 小於 20 psi; (E) 效度高，偽陽性機會 < 10%","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"MRI and Modic consensus 2023","url":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10403314/"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":["CT 與 MRI T1WI/T2WI 明顯混用；官方 B 並非字面正確"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-47","year":115,"number":47,"topic":"未分類","text":"Which statement about spinal cord nociceptive processing is wrong?","options":["spinothalamic tract, located within the ventrolateral white matter of the spinal cord, has been demonstrated en route to supraspinal sites with the predominant path for axonal projections traveling to the ipsilateral ventrobasal thalamus in responses to most somatic noxious stimuli","spinothalamic tract neurons have demonstrated a predominance for neurons processing nociceptive information","the soma of postsynaptic dorsal column neurons are located predominantly in lamina III, IV, and X, and the neurons have been demonstrated to be responsive to both somatic and visceral nociceptive inputs","glutamate is the primary excitatory amino acid neurotransmitter in afferent nociception","descending noradrenergic and serotonergic fibers originating in the brainstem produce inhibitory or excitatory effects on second-order spinal neurons, therefore serve as the mechanisms of descending inhibition or facilitation"],"officialAnswer":"A","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 A。Spinothalamic tract 多數體感傷害訊息在脊髓前白連合交叉後經對側 anterolateral system 上行到丘腦，因此 A 所寫的 ipsilateral ventrobasal thalamus 為錯。B 描述傷害感受主導的投射，C postsynaptic dorsal column 系統涉及內臟／深部傳入，D glutamate 是重要快興奮性傳遞物質，E 下降 5-HT/NE 可呈抑制或促通。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019; Chapter 4 Substrates of spinal cord nociceptive processing, Spinothalamic tract, Ventrolateral (Anterolateral) Axonal Pathways; The most studied spinal projection pathway is the spinothalamic tract which is located within the ventrolateral white matter of the spinal cord. Both ipsilateral and contralateral localization of axon pathways have been demonstrated en route to supraspinal sites, but the predominant path for axonal projections traveling to the ventrobasal thalamus resides on the contralateral side. p319","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-48","year":115,"number":48,"topic":"未分類","text":"關於纖維肌痛症(fibromylagia)的敘述，下列哪些正確？ 1- 纖維肌痛症發生率以男性較高 2- 纖維肌痛症的患者中壓痛點通常女性較男性多 3- 纖維肌痛症常常是許多其他慢性疼痛的共病(commobidity) 4- 因病人疼痛點多發且難治，應盡量讓病人多休息並限制運動 5- 較常見的藥物治療包含 gabapentinoids, tricyclic anti-depressants, selective norepinephrine reuptake inhibitor 或 opioid 等等","options":["1, 2, 4","1, 4, 5","1, 3, 5","2, 3, 5","2, 4, 5"],"officialAnswer":"D","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"disputed","explanation":"官方 D（2、3、5），但其中 5 把 opioid 混入常見藥物治療，與現行 fibromyalgia 指引不合。1 女性較常見，故『男性較高』錯；2 過去壓痛點研究女性較多；3 FM 可與其他慢性疼痛共病；4 規律分級運動優於長期限制活動；5 gabapentinoids、TCA、SNRI 有使用情境，但**強效 opioid 通常不建議**。因此這題沒有完全符合現行建議的乾淨選項，應保留官方 D 並標註爭議。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019; Chapter 36 Fibromyalgia: A discrete Disease or the End of the Continuum, p1739-1782","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"},{"title":"HAS 2025 Fibromyalgia guideline","url":"https://www.has-sante.fr/jcms/p_3689474/fr/fibromyalgia-in-adults-diagnostic-management-and-treatment-strategy-guideline-2025"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":["選項 5 包含 opioid，不符合現行 fibromyalgia 治療指引"],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-49","year":115,"number":49,"topic":"未分類","text":"During peripheral sensitization of nociceptors, which of the coupling is wrong?","options":["prostaglandin E2 (PGE2) --- EP receptor","bradykinin --- B2 receptor","heat --- TRPV1 receptor","ATP --- P2Y receptor","all of the above are right"],"officialAnswer":"E","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 E。PGE2 作用於 EP family receptors、bradykinin 常經 B2、熱感與 TRPV1、ATP 經 purinergic receptors（包括 P2X、部分 P2Y）調控 nociceptor，因此 A–D 都有生理學根據，選 E『以上配對皆對』。需分清 ATP 的快速離子通道反應常見 P2X3；P2Y 是代謝型訊號，也可參與 sensitization。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019; Chapter 3 Peripheral Pain Mechanisms and Nociceptor Sensitization, p263-294; prostaglandin E2 (PGE2) --- EP, Figure 3.1,B, p272; Figure 3.1 Nociceptive afferents.., Several different classes of TRP channels are involved in transduction of changes in temperature from noxious cold (TRPA1,ankyrin type 1), cool (TRPM8, melastatin type 8), warm (TRPV4), and hot (TRPV1, vanilloid type 1).p273-274; ATP and its metabolites act at ionotropic P2X and metabotropic P2Y receptors to modulate nociceptor excitability. p287-288; Chapter 4 Substrates of Spinal Cord Nociceptive Processing, Neurotransmitters from glia or unknown sources, bradykinin, which is normally known for its peripheral nervous system, activates B2 receptors in the dorsal horn with the subsequent induction of hyperalgesia phenomena. p338.","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"},{"id":"official-115-50","year":115,"number":50,"topic":"未分類","text":"以下為 failed back surgery syndrome 常見的鑑別診斷與其常見症狀,下列何者配對有誤?","options":["Lateral canal stenosis: relief with sitting","Painful discs: relief with sitting","Neuropathic pain: Leg pain Burning; Dysesthesia","Recurrent Herniated Nucleus Pulposus: Vary with location; Leg pain > low back pain","Sacroiliac joint pain: Gluteal pain with referral to leg and groin"],"officialAnswer":"B","verifiedAnswer":null,"verified":"pending","explanation":"官方 B。椎間盤源性疼痛常因坐姿、前彎、軸向負荷而惡化，不是典型 'relief with sitting'；因此 B 配對錯。Lateral recess／central stenosis 的 neurogenic claudication 常坐下或前彎緩解（A）；C neuropathic pain 可有燒灼、麻刺；D recurrent HNP 可腿痛較背痛明顯；E SIJ 常在臀部痛並可轉移至腿及腹股溝。","officialNote":"考題出處：Bonica's Management of Pain Fifth Edition, 2019; Chapter 75 Failed Back Surgery, Table 75.3 Differential Diagnosis of Common Causes of Failed Back Surgery by Symptoms, Signs, Radiology and Injections: Painful disk, LBP; worse with sitting, p3993","sources":[{"title":"115 年學會原始考題","url":"https://pain.org.tw/index.php/exam_page/index/6/1"}],"origin":"official","sourceFile":"115.doc","page":null,"parseWarning":[],"importQC":"人工需再確認完整原題；官方答案未經逐題醫學查證"}]);
